---
interface Props { lang: "fr" | "en"; figure: 1 | 2 | 3; }
const { lang, figure } = Astro.props;
---

{lang === "fr" && figure === 1 && (
<figure class="commerce-buyers-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 414" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces04-fr-1-title traces04-fr-1-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces04-fr-1-title">GM : deux livraisons différentes</title>
<desc id="traces04-fr-1-desc">Ventes GM de 2020 à 2024 décrites par la plainte californienne du 8 mai 2026. Verisk recevait identité et conduite sans GPS précis ; LexisNexis recevait aussi le GPS précis sans l’utiliser pour ses notes. Selon la plainte, aucun rapport sur les conducteurs californiens n’avait été commandé par les assureurs. Règlement sans admission.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="414" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">GM : deux livraisons différentes</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Ventes 2020–2024 · États-Unis</text>
<text x="20" y="110" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">GM → Verisk</text>
<text x="20" y="139" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Identité et données de conduite</text>
<text x="20" y="168" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">GPS précis exclu</text>
<line x1="20" y1="190" x2="460" y2="190" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="222" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">GM → LexisNexis</text>
<text x="20" y="251" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Identité, conduite et GPS précis</text>
<text x="20" y="280" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">GPS inutilisé pour les notes</text>
<line x1="20" y1="302" x2="460" y2="302" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="335" font-size="21" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Selon l’enquête californienne :</text>
<text x="20" y="365" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">aucun rapport sur ses conducteurs</text>
<text x="20" y="394" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">commandé par les assureurs</text>
</svg>
<figcaption>Relations GM–Verisk et GM–LexisNexis décrites dans la plainte californienne du 8 mai 2026, §§13–19. Les transferts ont été confirmés par GM ; les champs et usages détaillés restent ceux rapportés par les autorités. <a href="https://oag.ca.gov/system/files/attachments/press-docs/May%208%2C%202026%20GM%20Complaint%20Court%20Stamped.pdf">S01</a> <a href="https://news.gm.com/home.detail.html/Pages/news/us/en/2024/apr/0424-driver.html">S04</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "fr" && figure === 2 && (
<figure class="commerce-buyers-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 438" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces04-fr-2-title traces04-fr-2-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces04-fr-2-title">Deux achats publics distincts</title>
<desc id="traces04-fr-2-desc">Comparaison de contrats, pas chaîne commune. CBP achetait un accès au portail mondial de localisation mobile Venntel pour 2019–2020. Les CDC achetaient des données de lieux et des statistiques de mobilité SafeGraph pour 2021–2022. Le contrat évoque aussi des analyses au niveau GPS et exige des données anonymisées. Ces contrats ne prouvent pas seuls l’usage effectif.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="438" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Deux achats publics distincts</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Prestations prévues aux contrats</text>
<text x="20" y="108" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">CBP · Venntel</text>
<text x="460" y="108" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end">2019–2020</text>
<text x="20" y="139" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Accès par portail</text>
<text x="20" y="170" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Base mondiale de localisation mobile</text>
<text x="20" y="201" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Support et formation par licence</text>
<line x1="20" y1="225" x2="460" y2="225" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="264" font-size="23" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">CDC · SafeGraph</text>
<text x="460" y="264" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end">2021–2022</text>
<text x="20" y="295" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Lieux et statistiques de mobilité</text>
<text x="20" y="326" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Analyses au niveau GPS aussi prévues</text>
<text x="20" y="357" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Anonymisation exigée par contrat</text>
<line x1="20" y1="379" x2="460" y2="379" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="416" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Prestation prévue ≠ usage constaté</text>
</svg>
<figcaption>Comparaison des prestations prévues dans deux contrats distincts : CBP, 27 septembre 2019–25 septembre 2020 ; CDC, 16 avril 2021–15 avril 2022. Aucune relation commune en amont n’est déduite. <a href="https://assets.aclu.org/live/uploads/2022/07/2023-10-03-CBPs-Fourth-Production-Reprocessed.pdf">S11</a> <a href="https://s3.documentcloud.org/documents/23696555/cdc-safegraph-contract.pdf">S16</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "fr" && figure === 3 && (
<figure class="commerce-buyers-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 452" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces04-fr-3-title traces04-fr-3-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces04-fr-3-title">Quatre montants, quatre périmètres</title>
<desc id="traces04-fr-3-desc">Dollars américains nominaux, non comparables et non additionnables. Environ 20 millions de recettes nationales alléguées pour GM en 2020–2024 ; environ 2 millions par an prévus au premier ordre Omnicom de décembre 2017 ; 475 944,49 d’engagements envers Govplace pour 2020–2021 ; contrat CDC–SafeGraph d’un an à 420 000 pour 2021–2022. Aucun prix universel par personne ne peut en être déduit.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="452" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Quatre montants, quatre périmètres</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Dollars US nominaux · pièces distinctes</text>
<text x="20" y="110" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">GM</text>
<text x="460" y="110" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">≈ 20 M$</text>
<text x="20" y="140" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Recettes alléguées · 2020–2024</text>
<line x1="20" y1="159" x2="460" y2="159" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="190" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Omnicom</text>
<text x="460" y="190" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">≈ 2 M$ / an</text>
<text x="20" y="220" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Tarif prévu · décembre 2017</text>
<line x1="20" y1="239" x2="460" y2="239" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="270" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Govplace</text>
<text x="460" y="270" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">475 944,49 $</text>
<text x="20" y="300" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Engagements · 2020–2021</text>
<line x1="20" y1="319" x2="460" y2="319" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="350" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">CDC / SafeGraph</text>
<text x="460" y="350" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">420 000 $</text>
<text x="20" y="380" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Contrat d’un an · 2021–2022</text>
<line x1="20" y1="399" x2="460" y2="399" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="430" font-size="21" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Ces montants ne s’additionnent pas</text>
</svg>
<figcaption>Montants en dollars américains nominaux, sans conversion. Le statut comptable, la période et le périmètre sont indiqués pour chaque ligne ; les valeurs ne constituent pas une série comparable. <a href="https://oag.ca.gov/system/files/attachments/press-docs/May%208%2C%202026%20GM%20Complaint%20Court%20Stamped.pdf">S01</a> <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/ftc_gov/pdf/Complaint-Avast.pdf">S08</a> <a href="https://www.usaspending.gov/award/CONT_AWD_70B04C20F00000914_7014_HSHQDC13D00022_7001">S12</a> <a href="https://s3.documentcloud.org/documents/23696555/cdc-safegraph-contract.pdf">S16</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "en" && figure === 1 && (
<figure class="commerce-buyers-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 414" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces04-en-1-title traces04-en-1-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces04-en-1-title">GM: two different deliveries</title>
<desc id="traces04-en-1-desc">GM sales in 2020–2024 as described in the California complaint of May 8, 2026. Verisk received identity and driving data without precise GPS; LexisNexis also received precise GPS but did not use it in driving scores. The complaint says insurers had not ordered reports on California drivers. Settled without admission.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="414" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">GM: two different deliveries</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">2020–2024 sales · United States</text>
<text x="20" y="110" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">GM → Verisk</text>
<text x="20" y="139" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Identity and driving data</text>
<text x="20" y="168" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Precise GPS excluded</text>
<line x1="20" y1="190" x2="460" y2="190" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="222" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">GM → LexisNexis</text>
<text x="20" y="251" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Identity, driving and precise GPS</text>
<text x="20" y="280" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">GPS not used in scores</text>
<line x1="20" y1="302" x2="460" y2="302" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="335" font-size="21" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">California investigation:</text>
<text x="20" y="365" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">no reports ordered</text>
<text x="20" y="394" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">by insurers on California drivers</text>
</svg>
<figcaption>GM–Verisk and GM–LexisNexis relationships described in California’s May 8, 2026 complaint, §§13–19. GM confirmed the transfers; field-level detail and uses are reported by the authorities. <a href="https://oag.ca.gov/system/files/attachments/press-docs/May%208%2C%202026%20GM%20Complaint%20Court%20Stamped.pdf">S01</a> <a href="https://news.gm.com/home.detail.html/Pages/news/us/en/2024/apr/0424-driver.html">S04</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "en" && figure === 2 && (
<figure class="commerce-buyers-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 438" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces04-en-2-title traces04-en-2-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces04-en-2-title">Two distinct public purchases</title>
<desc id="traces04-en-2-desc">Contract comparison, not a common supply chain. CBP procured Venntel portal access to a global mobile-location database for 2019–2020. The CDC purchased SafeGraph place data and aggregate mobility patterns for 2021–2022. Its contract also mentions GPS-level analysis and requires anonymised data. Neither contract alone establishes actual use.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="438" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="24" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Two distinct public purchases</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Services specified in contracts</text>
<text x="20" y="108" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">CBP · Venntel</text>
<text x="460" y="108" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end">2019–2020</text>
<text x="20" y="139" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Portal access</text>
<text x="20" y="170" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Global mobile-location database</text>
<text x="20" y="201" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Support and training per licence</text>
<line x1="20" y1="225" x2="460" y2="225" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="264" font-size="23" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">CDC · SafeGraph</text>
<text x="460" y="264" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="end">2021–2022</text>
<text x="20" y="295" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Place data and mobility statistics</text>
<text x="20" y="326" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">GPS-level analysis also specified</text>
<text x="20" y="357" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Anonymisation required by contract</text>
<line x1="20" y1="379" x2="460" y2="379" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="416" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Contracted scope ≠ observed use</text>
</svg>
<figcaption>Contracted services in two separate agreements: CBP, September 27, 2019–September 25, 2020 ; CDC, April 16, 2021–April 15, 2022. No common upstream data relationship is inferred. <a href="https://assets.aclu.org/live/uploads/2022/07/2023-10-03-CBPs-Fourth-Production-Reprocessed.pdf">S11</a> <a href="https://s3.documentcloud.org/documents/23696555/cdc-safegraph-contract.pdf">S16</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "en" && figure === 3 && (
<figure class="commerce-buyers-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 452" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces04-en-3-title traces04-en-3-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces04-en-3-title">Four amounts, four different scopes</title>
<desc id="traces04-en-3-desc">Nominal US dollars, not comparable or additive. Approximately 20 million in alleged nationwide GM proceeds in 2020–2024; approximately 2 million per year in the first Omnicom work order of December 2017; 475,944.49 in Govplace award obligations for 2020–2021; 420,000 in the CDC–SafeGraph one-year contract for 2021–2022. These records do not establish a universal price per person.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="452" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Four amounts, four different scopes</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Nominal US dollars · separate records</text>
<text x="20" y="110" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">GM</text>
<text x="460" y="110" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">≈ $20m</text>
<text x="20" y="140" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Alleged proceeds · 2020–2024</text>
<line x1="20" y1="159" x2="460" y2="159" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="190" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Omnicom</text>
<text x="460" y="190" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">≈ $2m / year</text>
<text x="20" y="220" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Contracted fee · December 2017</text>
<line x1="20" y1="239" x2="460" y2="239" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="270" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Govplace</text>
<text x="460" y="270" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">$475,944.49</text>
<text x="20" y="300" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Obligations · 2020–2021</text>
<line x1="20" y1="319" x2="460" y2="319" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="350" font-size="22" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">CDC / SafeGraph</text>
<text x="460" y="350" font-size="23" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end">$420,000</text>
<text x="20" y="380" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">One-year contract · 2021–2022</text>
<line x1="20" y1="399" x2="460" y2="399" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text x="20" y="430" font-size="21" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">These amounts must not be added</text>
</svg>
<figcaption>Nominal US dollars, without conversion. Each item identifies its accounting status, period and scope; the values do not form a comparable series. <a href="https://oag.ca.gov/system/files/attachments/press-docs/May%208%2C%202026%20GM%20Complaint%20Court%20Stamped.pdf">S01</a> <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/system/files/ftc_gov/pdf/Complaint-Avast.pdf">S08</a> <a href="https://www.usaspending.gov/award/CONT_AWD_70B04C20F00000914_7014_HSHQDC13D00022_7001">S12</a> <a href="https://s3.documentcloud.org/documents/23696555/cdc-safegraph-contract.pdf">S16</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

<style>
